    "text": "By Mickenzie Hannon ,\n8 hours ago A yellow school bus packed with community leaders, volunteers and golden trophies rolled through Collier County Monday morning, stopping at six schools where classrooms erupted in cheers. The bus carried the Golden Apple \"Prize Patrol,\" organized by nonprofit group Champions for Learning, which surprised six educators on March 16 after... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
